cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this knowledge base, please cite both this derivative and the original shiji-kb by Bao Jie."
title: "shiji-kb (derivative): Records of the Grand Historian Knowledge Base"
authors:
  - alias: "langking1982"
    website: "https://github.com/langking1982"
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/langking1982/shiji-kb"
abstract: >-
  An interactive knowledge graph built from the Records of the Grand Historian
  (史记): 14,065 entities, 126,441 annotations across 22 types, 3,198 historical
  events, and 130 interactive timelines. This is a community derivative of
  baojie/shiji-kb with compliance and engineering upgrades. AI-assisted
  annotation; not an authoritative historical source.
keywords:
